{"suttaId":"thi-ap26","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[9143,9213],"vripara":"220"},"segments":{"thi-ap26:0.3":"Soṇātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap26:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap26:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap26:2.1":"“Tadā seṭṭhikule jātā, sukhitā pūjitā piyā;","thi-ap26:2.3":"Upetvā taṃ munivaraṃ, assosiṃ madhuraṃ vacaṃ.","thi-ap26:3.1":"“Āraddhavīriyānaggaṃ, vaṇṇesi [vaṇṇeti (syā.)] bhikkhuniṃ jino;","thi-ap26:3.3":"Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, kāraṃ katvāna satthuno.","thi-ap26:4.1":"“Abhivādiya sambuddhaṃ, ṭhānaṃ taṃ patthayiṃ tadā;","thi-ap26:4.3":"Anumodi mahāvīro,‘sijjhataṃ paṇidhī tava.","thi-ap26:5.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap26:5.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap26:6.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap26:6.3":"Soṇāti nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap26:7.1":"“Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","thi-ap26:7.3":"Mettacittā paricariṃ, paccayehi vināyakaṃ.","thi-ap26:8.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap26:8.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap26:9.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jātā seṭṭhikule ahaṃ;","thi-ap26:9.3":"Sāvatthiyaṃ puravare, iddhe phīte mahaddhane.","thi-ap26:10.1":"“Yadā ca yobbanappattā, gantvā patikulaṃ ahaṃ;","thi-ap26:10.3":"Dasa puttāni ajaniṃ, surūpāni visesato.","thi-ap26:11.1":"“Sukhedhitā ca te sabbe, jananettamanoharā;","thi-ap26:11.3":"Amittānampi rucitā, mama pageva te piyā.","thi-ap26:12.1":"“Tato mayhaṃ akāmāya, dasaputtapurakkhato;","thi-ap26:12.3":"Pabbajittha sa me bhattā, devadevassa sāsane.","thi-ap26:13.1":"“Tadekikā vicintesiṃ, jīvitenālamatthu me;","thi-ap26:13.3":"Cattāya patiputtehi, vuḍḍhāya ca varākiyā.","thi-ap26:14.1":"“Ahampi tattha gacchissaṃ, sampatto yattha me pati;","thi-ap26:14.3":"Evāhaṃ cintayitvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap26:15.1":"“Tato ca maṃ bhikkhuniyo, ekaṃ bhikkhunupassaye;","thi-ap26:15.3":"Vihāya gacchumovādaṃ, tāpehi udakaṃ iti.","thi-ap26:16.1":"“Tadā udakamāhitvā, okiritvāna kumbhiyā;","thi-ap26:16.3":"Culle ṭhapetvā āsīnā, tato cittaṃ samādahiṃ.","thi-ap26:17.1":"“Khandhe aniccato disvā, dukkhato ca anattato;","thi-ap26:17.3":"Khepetvā āsave sabbe, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap26:18.1":"“Tadāgantvā bhikkhuniyo, uṇhodakamapucchisuṃ;","thi-ap26:18.3":"Tejodhātumadhiṭṭhāya, khippaṃ santāpayiṃ jalaṃ.","thi-ap26:19.1":"“Vimhitā tā jinavaraṃ, etamatthamasāvayuṃ;","thi-ap26:19.3":"Taṃ sutvā mudito nātho, imaṃ gāthaṃ abhāsatha.","thi-ap26:20.1":"“‘Yo ca vassasataṃ jīve, kusīto hīnavīriyo;","thi-ap26:20.3":"Ekāhaṃ jīvitaṃ seyyo, vīriyamārabhato daḷhaṃ’.","thi-ap26:21.1":"“Ārādhito mahāvīro, mayā suppaṭipattiyā;","thi-ap26:21.3":"Āraddhavīriyānaggaṃ, mamāha sa mahāmuni.","thi-ap26:22.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap26:23.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap26:24.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap26:25.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ soṇā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap26:26.1":"Soṇātheriyāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
